Reason: the GPU process advertises AAC with profile kUnknown (AAC-LC, HE-AAC)
as well as xHE-AAC, so MojoAudioDecoder accepts it and the renderer's
supported-types cache reports it (plan.md §3.3). No upstream bug.

diff --git a/media/mojo/services/gpu_mojo_media_client_mac.cc b/media/mojo/services/gpu_mojo_media_client_mac.cc
